# .agentignore — Agent Context Hygiene Rules
# Reference: Slide 10.6.3 — Context Pollution Prevention
#
# Cấu hình này hướng dẫn AI Agents (Claude Code, Cline, Cursor, Roo Code)
# loại trừ các file/thư mục không cần thiết khỏi context window.
#
# Mục đích:
# - Tiết kiệm context window tokens
# - Tránh context pollution từ build artifacts và generated files
# - Tăng tốc độ search/glob của agent
#
# Syntax: Tương tự .gitignore (glob patterns, # = comment, ! = negation)

# ============================================================
# 1. DEPENDENCY & PACKAGE DIRECTORIES
# ============================================================
node_modules/
vendor/
.pnp/
.pnp.js
bower_components/

# ============================================================
# 2. BUILD & COMPILED OUTPUT
# ============================================================
dist/
build/
out/
.next/
.nuxt/
.output/
.cache/
.turbo/
*.js.map
*.d.ts.map

# ============================================================
# 3. LOGS & RUNTIME FILES
# ============================================================
*.log
*.log.*
logs/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

# ============================================================
# 4. GENERATED PROTOBUF & GRPC FILES
# ============================================================
*.pb.go
*.pb.ts
*.pb.js
*_pb.js
*_grpc.js
*_grpc_pb.js
generated/
proto-gen/

# ============================================================
# 5. BINARY & MEDIA FILES
# ============================================================
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
*.ico
*.svg
*.woff
*.woff2
*.ttf
*.eot
*.mp4
*.mp3
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.rar
*.pdf
# Exception: slide PDFs in slides/ are needed for reference
!slides/*.pdf
!slides/*.txt

# ============================================================
# 6. ENVIRONMENT & SECRETS (CRITICAL — never include)
# ============================================================
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.cert
secrets/
credentials/

# ============================================================
# 7. IDE & EDITOR ARTIFACTS
# ============================================================
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ============================================================
# 8. TEST COVERAGE & SNAPSHOTS
# ============================================================
coverage/
.nyc_output/
*.snap
__snapshots__/

# ============================================================
# 9. DOCKER & INFRASTRUCTURE ARTIFACTS
# ============================================================
.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.backup
.terraform.lock.hcl

# ============================================================
# 10. LOCK FILES (reference but don't analyze deeply)
# ============================================================
# package-lock.json    # Uncomment to exclude if context is tight
# yarn.lock            # Uncomment to exclude if context is tight
# pnpm-lock.yaml       # Uncomment to exclude if context is tight

# ============================================================
# AGENT TOOL CONFIGURATION NOTES
# ============================================================
# Claude Code: Uses .gitignore + this file for context exclusion.
#   In CLAUDE.md, reference this file under "Context Hygiene".
#
# Cline / Roo Code: Add exclude patterns in settings:
#   "cline.excludePatterns": ["node_modules/**", "dist/**", "*.log"]
#
# Cursor: Configure in .cursorignore (same syntax as this file).
#   Copy relevant sections to .cursorignore.
